From 451e95c6fdfa21416d93114919042d0c737be6fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wojtek Mach <wojtek@wojtekmach.pl>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 22:35:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] erts: Compile the code of erlaotc executables ahead of
 time

erlaotc runs the executable in recording mode, which loads every module
and saves the code the JIT generated for it in a JITC chunk of the BEAM
file, together with a snapshot of the atom table so that atoms need no
relocation. The loader installs that code instead of running the JIT.
AArch64 and x86_64.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MVJPWKb8jPWu1ctZmLCAAH
